  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "领地不容侵犯  (Territory Off Limits)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right after discussing Chun Yuqiao's work style, Xingzi lowers her voice to ask Bu Xiaogu about her friendship with the Fentuan leader. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是小谷你知道吗，在有些方面，他是个领地不容侵犯的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你跟那个粉丝团头子，是不是混得挺熟的了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大出院那天，直播间的事我都听说了，包括一些细节。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你们俩之间，是不是已经挺亲密的了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有没有，杏子姐，我跟你说啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我发誓，我绝对没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以杏子姐，这个跟淳于总那天生气有什么关系吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总那天生气，难道是因为这个？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "江湖险恶，行事还是要检点一些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然的话，可能会伤了别人的感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，有些事情你还不太清楚，慢慢悟吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是小谷你知道吗，在有些方面，他是个领地不容侵犯的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet Xiaogu, do you know that in certain matters he never lets anyone intrude on his territory?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你跟那个粉丝团头子，是不是混得挺熟的了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you grown pretty familiar with that fan-club leader?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大出院那天，直播间的事我都听说了，包括一些细节。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard all about the livestream on the day the boss left the hospital, including the details.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你们俩之间，是不是已经挺亲密的了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have the two of you already become quite close?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有没有，杏子姐，我跟你说啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, not at all, Xingzi, let me tell you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我发誓，我绝对没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I swear I definitely have not!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以杏子姐，这个跟淳于总那天生气有什么关系吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So Xingzi, does this have anything to do with why Chun Yuqiao got angry that day?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总那天生气，难道是因为这个？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could Chun Yuqiao really have been angry that day because of this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "江湖险恶，行事还是要检点一些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The world out there is tricky, so be mindful of how you act.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然的话，可能会伤了别人的感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise, you might end up hurting someone's feelings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，有些事情你还不太清楚，慢慢悟吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, there are things you still do not quite see yet; figure them out slowly.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
